: "Contributor", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-01-crypto.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_01_crypto_json_gem_pinned_to_2_x", "label": "json gem pinned to 2.x", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-01-crypto.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ruby 4.0.7 bundles json 3.0.2 whose JSON.parse takes keyword-only options, while ActiveSupport 8.1.3.1 passes a positional hash, so every jsonb read and JSON body raised ArgumentError and the schema dumper silently omitted the contributors table; pinning 2.21.2 keeps both Ruby 4.0.7 and Rails 8.1.3.1 in place until the next Rails patch."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_01_crypto_uuidv7_assigned_in_ruby", "label": "UUIDv7 primary keys assigned in Ruby", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-01-crypto.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Postgres 16 has no native uuidv7(), so ids are assigned by an ApplicationRecord callback and the migration sets no database default, making a silent v4 id impossible; the Rails auth tables keep bigint ids because they are not ledger tables."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_01_crypto_cross_implementation_test_vectors", "label": "Cross-implementation test vectors", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-01-crypto.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Expected canonical bytes and hashes were generated by an independent Python script rather than by the Ruby code, so the implementation is checked against a second one as 04 SS11 intends; RFC 8785 and RFC 8032 published vectors pin the rest."}], "edges": [{"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_01_crypto_stage_1_crypto", "target": "app_models_application_record_applicationrecord", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-01-crypto.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_01_crypto_stage_1_crypto", "target": "app_services_crypto_canonical_json_canonicaljson", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-01-crypto.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_01_crypto_stage_1_crypto", "target": "app_services_crypto_hashing_hashing", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-01-crypto.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_01_crypto_stage_1_crypto", "target": "app_services_crypto_ed25519_ed25519", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-01-crypto.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_01_crypto_stage_1_crypto", "target": "app_services_crypto_custody_custody", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-01-crypto.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_01_crypto_stage_1_crypto", "target": "app_services_crypto_system_key_systemkey", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-01-crypto.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_01_crypto_stage_1_crypto", "target": "app_models_contributor_co